 the slicing of the EEG signals into samples, as described in our paper. We believe it should be straightforward to implement based on the provided details.\n\n3. You're absolutely right in your observation. TUAB is a large dataset, and the abnormality detection task can be relatively simple, which makes overfitting likely. In our experiments, we selected the best epoch based on validation performance—often the first epoch—and reported results on the test set from that checkpoint.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2870835041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2922001102","html_url":"https://github.com/935963004/LaBraM/issues/60#issuecomment-2922001102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/60","id":2922001102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLF0fBs6uKjLO","user":{"login":"ChenHu-ML","id":132742902,"node_id":"U_kgDOB-l-9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132742902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML","html_url":"https://github.com/ChenHu-ML","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenHu-ML/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":f